She's just a generic cat.

16
00:00:50,429 --> 00:00:52,309
(Sheldon:)And that's the kind
of sloppy costuming...

17
00:00:52,473 --> 00:00:55,723
(Sheldon:)...which results
from a lack of rules and competition.

18
